    "headline": "James P. Holland to Join Humana as Medicaid President",
    "summary": "LOUISVILLE, Ky., August 10, 2026--Humana Inc. (NYSE: HUM) today announced that James \"J.P.\" Holland will join the company as senior vice president and President of Medicaid, effective August 17. In this role, Holland will lead the company’s growing Medicaid business, which currently serves more than 1.6 million members in 11 states. Holland will report to Aaron Martin, President of Insurance.",
